### RAIL : recherche
GET http://localhost:8082/v1/offers?origin=Casablanca&destination=Rabat&date=2026-11-15

### RAIL : hold
POST http://localhost:8082/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","seats":2}

> {% client.global.set("railHold", response.body.holdId); %}

### RAIL : confirm
POST http://localhost:8082/v1/holds/{{railHold}}/confirm

> {% client.global.set("railRef", response.body.bookingRef); %}

### RAIL : cancel (rejouable, toujours 200)
DELETE http://localhost:8082/v1/references/{{railRef}}

### RAIL : hold sur un trajet inconnu (409)
POST http://localhost:8082/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":"RAIL:TRAJET-INEXISTANT","seats":1}

### AIR : recherche
GET http://localhost:8083/v1/offers?origin=Rabat&destination=Paris&date=2026-11-15

### AIR : hold
POST http://localhost:8083/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":"AIR:AIR-RBA-ORY-1200","seats":1}

> {% client.global.set("airHold", response.body.holdId); %}

### AIR : confirm
POST http://localhost:8083/v1/holds/{{airHold}}/confirm

> {% client.global.set("airRef", response.body.bookingRef); %}

### AIR : cancel (rejouable, toujours 200)
DELETE http://localhost:8083/v1/references/{{airRef}}

### AIR : 4 places sur un vol qui en a 3 (409, sert à la compensation)
POST http://localhost:8083/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":"AIR:AIR-CMN-MAD-1800","seats":4}

### Date invalide (400)
GET http://localhost:8083/v1/offers?origin=Rabat&destination=Paris&date=15-11-2026